{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bx9YfnZ7Jh1792042147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股反覆造好，一度反彈逾100點。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開42點後，走勢反覆向好，最多升過116點，上試23,100點水平。</p><p></p><p>科網股造好，阿里巴巴升百分之2。聯想集團升百分之6，為表現最好藍籌。滙控也反彈百分之2，上試138元水平。不過，賭業股受壓，銀娛及金沙齊跌百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:58.126870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:38:09.756011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:24.023168+00:00","content_hash":"b043ee0f0c304e28de16784824a126fd2de29888e8058955789cbf69fe1566cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:58.126870+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}